# Implementation Plan - Robust Notification System

This plan outlines the steps to implement a cross-platform notification system (Web PWA + Native) for Chess Master. The primary focus is on **Online Multiplayer Invites**, ensuring users receive OS-level notifications even when the app is backgrounded or closed.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **VAPID Keys (Web Push)**: This implementation will use the **W3C Push API (VAPID)**. You will need to:
> 1. Generate a VAPID Public/Private key pair (I can provide the script).
> 2. Add the `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY` and `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY` to your Cloudflare Worker environment variables.
> 3. No Firebase project is required.

> [!NOTE]
> **Direct Installation**: As requested, we are removing the forced App Store/Play Store redirects.
> - **Android**: A direct link to download the `.apk`.
> - **iOS/macOS**: A placeholder link for a `.dmg` or `.ipa` bundle.
> - **PWA**: The primary install vector for Web users.

